      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city boasts Missouri\u2019s largest Amish community, where traditional crafts and farm life remain a living part of daily life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamesport%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic brick storefronts line Jamesport\u2019s main street, their weathered facades telling stories of railroad boom days and rural resilience.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://familydestinationsguide.com/amish-tiny-town-missouri/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At the heart of downtown, the Gingerich Dutch Bakery draws visitors with its cinnamon\u2011butter pastries, a taste that rivals any supermarket loaf.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://familydestinationsguide.com/amish-tiny-town-missouri/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
